WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:01.710
. Hey, David.

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:06.240
Donald Trump famously said he could shoot
people on Fifth Avenue and not lose any support.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:09.710
What would it take for Trump's base to abandon
him?

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:12.200
So I've said before.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.500
Would Trump's base abandon him if he insulted
them?

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.980
If he said my base is filled with just trash
losers I'd never be caught dead with?

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:28.210
I still think even in that case, a lot of
Trump voters would say he wasn't insulting

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.210
me.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.380
He met somebody else.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:34.109
He didn't mean me when he talked about his
supporters that he hates.

00:00:34.109 --> 00:00:41.489
I still don't think that attacking his own
base would get a large number of Trump supporters

00:00:41.489 --> 00:00:42.929
to abandon him.

00:00:42.929 --> 00:00:49.600
However, I do believe there are people who
would abandon Trump if he loudly came out

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.620
in favor of women's right to choose an abortion.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:01:01.890
If it's right for them, Donald Trump has maintained
this absurd, unbelievable lie that even though

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.180
he was pro-choice his entire life until he
was 68 years old, that when he was in his

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:11.520
late 60s, he met a kid and he liked the kid.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:16.320
And the kid's mom said, you know, I thought
about having an abortion, but I decided not

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:17.320
to.

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:22.880
Trump claims that was an awakening moment
for him, where he said, I've got to be against

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:23.880
abortion.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:24.880
It's an obvious lie.

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:25.880
Trump clearly is pro-choice.

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:26.880
It wouldn't be shocking.

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:31.689
To me, if Trump has paid for abortions for
some of his mistresses, it wouldn't surprise

00:01:31.689 --> 00:01:32.689
me.

00:01:32.689 --> 00:01:37.320
I do think that there's a part of Trump's
base, the evangelical voters, where if Trump

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:38.320
said, hey, you know what?

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:42.079
This right to life stuff of the march for
life that I spoke at.

00:01:42.079 --> 00:01:44.149
No, I'm pro-choice.

00:01:44.149 --> 00:01:49.470
I do think a lot of those anti-abortion voters
would abandon Donald Trump.

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:55.299
But the reality is, it's not a huge part of
Trump's base.

00:01:55.299 --> 00:01:57.030
Evangelicals aren't really his base.

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:59.650
They came to him after mostly supporting.

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:03.439
I think it was Ted Cruz and others in 2016.

00:02:03.439 --> 00:02:08.720
They went to Trump when the options were Trump
or Hillary, and they certainly were going

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:10.890
to be voting for Hillary Clinton.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:16.220
I really don't know what it would take for
Trump's real base to abandon him.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:19.060
I actually think they would be in denial.

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:20.350
No matter what.

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:24.990
And they would support him if Trump came out
and was loudly anti-gun.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:26.930
Maybe some of his base would abandon him.

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:33.360
But even then, Trump has said some relatively
anti-gun things.

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:36.630
But then he'll come back and say Joe Biden
will cancel the Second Amendment.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:39.170
And it's kind of like a choose your own adventure.

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:40.730
I like this thing, Trump said.

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:43.750
So I'm going to believe that that's his real
position.

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:51.820
I really can't think of anything Trump could
do to get the bulk of his real base to abandon

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:52.820
him.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:53.890
I want to hear from you.

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:55.340
Is there something he could do?

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:58.410
Am I onto something with the gun idea?

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:04.110
Is baby the abortion issue bigger for more
of his base than just the evangelicals that

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:05.180
I'm conceding?

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:06.770
Let me know what you think.

